<title>PHILIPPINES: Asia Amalgamated to go into real estate.</title>
<headline>Asia Amalgamated to go into real estate.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asia Amalgamated Holdings Corp said on Friday its board had decided to set up two subsidiaries engaged in real estate and construction.</p>
<p>&quot;Each company will have an authorised capital stock of 100 million pesos and the initial paid-up subscription of the company to each entity shall be 6.25 million pesos,&quot; the company told the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Asia Amalgamated is the financial services company of the Gow family, majority owner of Uniwide Holdings Inc.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 632 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
